@startuml
title UML-Klassendiagramm: 12 Domänenklassen (Stand Sprint 1, 10.11.2026)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty methods

class User <<Django>> {
  +username: str
  +first_name: str
  +last_name: str
  +is_active: bool
}

class Employee {
  +contract_type: str {vollzeit, teilzeit, studierende, minijob}
  +weekly_hours: decimal [1..48]
}

class Qualification {
  +name: str {unique}
  +description: str
}

class ShiftTemplate {
  +name: str {unique}
  +start: time
  +end: time
  +description: str
}

class Month {
  +date: date {unique, Monatserster}
  +revision: int
  +demand_saved: bool
  +deadline: date [0..1]
  +open_weekdays: str
}

class MonthDay {
  +date: date
  +is_open: bool
}

class Slot {
  +date: date
  +total: int [0..30]
}

class Need {
  +count: int [0..30]
}

class Availability {
  +priority: int {0 = nicht verfügbar, 1..3}
}

class Submission {
  +submitted: bool
  +updated_at: datetime
}

class Vacation {
  +start: date
  +end: date
}

class Plan {
  +revision: int
  +created_at: datetime
  +duration_ms: int
}

class Assignment {
  +position: int
  +role: str
  +priority: int [0..1]
  .. Snapshot ..
  +date: date
  +shift_name: str
  +start: time
  +end: time
  +employee_name: str
}

User "1" -- "1" Employee : Konto
Employee "*" -- "*" Qualification : besitzt
Employee "1" -- "*" Availability : trägt ein
Employee "1" -- "*" Submission : gibt ab
Employee "1" -- "*" Vacation : hat

Month "1" *-- "*" MonthDay : Ausnahmen
Month "1" *-- "*" Slot : enthält
Month "1" -- "*" Submission : betrifft
Month "1" -- "0..1" Plan : hat
Slot "*" --> "1" ShiftTemplate : nutzt
Slot "1" *-- "*" Need : Besetzungsmix
Need "*" --> "1" Qualification : verlangt
Slot "1" -- "*" Availability : für

Plan "1" *-- "*" Assignment : enthält
Assignment "*" --> "1" Slot : besetzt
Assignment "*" --> "0..1" Employee : weist zu

note right of Assignment
  employee = NULL bedeutet „unbesetzt“ (REQ-09).
  Datum, Zeiten und Namen als Snapshot,
  damit ältere Pläne lesbar bleiben.
end note

note bottom of Month
  deadline: REQ-05 (ABW-01)
  open_weekdays: REQ-22, Standard Mo–Sa
end note

@enduml
